      "repair_reason": "- No automated repair is needed; maintainers need to choose the landing branch, decide the release-owned changelog state, and wait for normal exact-head CI gates.; Cleared: The diff changes Control UI TypeScript, UI tests, and a changelog line only; it does not change workflows, dependencies, lockfiles, secrets, permissions, package metadata, downloads, or code-execution surfaces. (sha=2009dceacb577b760a0f6780cd96b63c65a38831)",
      "review_summary": "The PR adds Control UI cron quick-create model selection, maps agent-turn selections into `payloadModel`, displays configured/default model labels in cron rows and details, and adds focused UI/E2E coverage plus a changelog entry.\n\nPR surface: Source +62, Tests +171, Docs +1. Total +234 across 7 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-level. Current main's quick-create draft and patch conversion omit a model field and `payloadModel` mapping, while row/detail rendering omits model labels despite the existing advanced-form model contract.",
